WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.050
The Queen of New Orleans

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:26.130
Part 1 The Queen is Crown

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:35.130
New Orleans 1805

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:39.130
Two hundred years ago New Orleans was quite a place to be

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.130
Lots of interest in people lived there or passed through

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:46.130
Musicians, gamblers, sailors

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:49.130
Some nights the French Quarter of the city was

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:57.130
Well let's say it was lively

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:02.130
Down in Congo Square or Flatts Congo was the people there called it

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.130
The scene was also pretty lively

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:08.130
It was a place where freed slaves used to go

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:11.130
A place where they worshiped a special kind of religion

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.130
This religion had a lot of different names

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:17.130
Backhand, Ifa or Isha

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.130
Nowadays we call it Voodoo

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:26.130
About that time there was a Voodoo Queen in New Orleans

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.130
Her name was Sanite Debe and everyone was afraid of them

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:34.130
Lots of people used to ask her for favors

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.180
But she made a good living out of it

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:42.130
What do you want?

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.130
I need your help

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:45.130
Oh yeah?

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:48.130
I owe somebody a lot of money

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:53.130
I want to know if you have anything that belongs to him

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:56.130
Yes, I managed to get this from him

00:01:56.180 --> 00:02:01.130
Nice handkerchief, guess he must be pretty rich

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.130
Yes he is

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.130
How much do you owe him?

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.130
$5,000

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:11.130
Then you're one stupid son of a bitch

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:13.130
It wasn't my fault

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.130
This is going to cost you money

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:17.130
I'll pay you what I can

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.130
You'll pay me $500

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:22.130
$500? I can't

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:25.130
$500? Take it or leave it

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:26.130
But I can't

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:28.130
Okay, goodbye

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.130
No, open the door, open the door

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.130
I'll pay you $500

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:35.180
Bring me half tomorrow

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:44.130
Sanite Debe was the number one Voodoo woman in New Orleans

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:47.130
But then, someone else came along

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:50.130
This is the story of Marie LaVoe

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:55.130
The woman who became the new Voodoo Queen of New Orleans

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.130
At the beginning of our story

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:00.180
Marie was just a simple hairdresser

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.130
Marie? Marie?

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.130
Hello Blanche

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.130
Marie, do you have time to cut my hair today?

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:10.130
Not now Blanche, no

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.130
Maybe tomorrow?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.130
Okay, I'll see you tomorrow

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:16.180
Fine, bye for now

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.130
Well, hello

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:24.130
Oh my god, you frightened me

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.130
I can't see anything with the blinds down

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.130
Who is it?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:31.130
Well Marie, don't you remember my voice

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:34.130
Jacques, is it you?

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.180
Show is

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:42.130
What do you think you're doing sitting here in the dark?

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.130
What do you want?

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:46.130
Marie, what do you think I want?

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.130
I don't know Jacques

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.130
I'm not a mind reader

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:54.130
Come on Marie, did you forget Friday night already?

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:57.130
Friday night was Friday night, Jacques

00:03:57.180 --> 00:04:00.130
Today is another day

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:04.180
And today could be another day like Friday Marie

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:17.130
There was quite a party the day that Marie LaVoe and Jacques Paris got married

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:19.130
Marie LaVoe

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:22.130
Fine looking woman, intelligent

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.130
And knew how to make an honest buck

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.130
Jacques Paris

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:30.130
Well, he was fine looking too but

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:35.130
Well, let's say he wasn't a regular kind of guy, you know

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:39.130
The kind that gets up in the morning and goes to work

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:45.130
If he was up in the morning, it was because he'd been up all night drinking and gambling

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.130
A lot of people were very surprised when Marie married someone

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.180
Like Jacques

00:04:53.180 --> 00:05:00.130
And do you, Marie, take Jacques to be your lawful wedded husband?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.130
I do

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:08.180
And do you, Jacques, take Marie to be your lawful wedded wife?

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.130
Jacques

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.180
Huh?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:20.130
Do you take this woman to be your lawful wedded wife?

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:22.130
Oh sure, preacher man

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:25.130
Jacques, just say I do

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.130
Okay, I do

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:32.130
Good, I now pronounce you man and wife, you may kiss the bride

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.180
It's all right, Mr. preacher, I already did that

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:48.130
Hey Marie, hi Blanche

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:51.130
What's it like to be a married woman?

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:53.180
When I find out, I'll tell you

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.130
Hello, Jacques

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.130
Well, hello

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:03.130
Now, do I know you?

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.130
You sure do

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.130
Refresh my memory, pretty lady

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:09.130
My name is Gina

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:13.130
We met in Baton Rouge a year or so ago

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:17.130
Ah, yes, very refreshing

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:21.130
So, Jacques, you went and got yourself a wife

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.130
I sure did

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:26.130
Marion Marie LaVoe was the best thing I ever did

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:29.130
You think so?

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:33.130
Well, now, you trying to tell me something?

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:38.180
Well, yes I am, but here ain't the right place to tell you

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:45.130
Marie, what is it Blanche?

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:48.130
I think you should go outside

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.130
Why should I do that Blanche?

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.130
I'm having a fine time here

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:58.180
Right, and Jacques is having a fine time out the bank

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:06.130
Oh, Jacques, it's so good to see you again

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:09.130
The show is, come here

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:10.130
Not here

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.130
Where then?

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:16.130
I have a room, second floor in a rooming house on Rose Street

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.130
Number 21

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.130
Why don't you come and see me there?

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:23.130
Show thing

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:25.130
There they are

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:27.130
Oh my God

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:29.130
Jesus, how do I get out of here?

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:31.130
There's no way out of here except through the house

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.130
Get behind the tree

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.130
What?

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.130
Get behind the tree

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:38.130
Jacques, are you out here?

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:39.130
Jacques?

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:42.130
Well, I'm Marie

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:44.130
You with someone, Jacques?

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:46.130
Will someone show as hell not?

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:48.130
I'm just taking the air

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:51.130
There's someone here I know there is

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:54.130
I think she's here

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:57.130
Wow, I like all my hair you bitch

00:07:57.180 --> 00:08:00.130
You're calling me a bitch?

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:01.130
Let go of me

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:04.130
You come after my husband on my wedding day

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.130
And you call me a bitch?

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.130
Let go of me

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.130
Get me one good reason why I should do that

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:12.130
Stop it, let me go

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:14.130
Okay, I'll let go of you

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.130
You're crazy

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:19.130
And now you're calling me names

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:23.130
Don't you dare call me names

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:25.130
Why you?

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:28.130
Get up

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:30.130
Don't get me again

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:32.130
Are you trying to kill me or something?

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:35.130
I'm not gonna touch you again, you piece of garbage

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:38.130
But if you ever go near my husband again

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:41.130
I really will kill you

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.130
Now get out of here

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:46.130
You're a mad woman, Marie Loveau

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:48.130
You regret doing this

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:50.130
Marie, are you okay?

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:51.130
I'm fine, Blanche

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:52.130
Do you need any help?

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.130
No, go away

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.130
I want to talk to Jacques alone

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.130
Okay, but yell if you need me

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.130
Okay

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.130
Marie

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:03.130
Don't talk, Jacques

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.130
Just listen

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.130
This is our wedding day

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:09.130
And I've just found you with another woman

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:11.130
Marie, we were just talking

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.130
In fact, I was just telling

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:15.130
Listen, you're my husband now

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:19.130
And from now on, you do things the way I want them

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:20.130
I was just...

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:21.130
Huh?

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.130
You hurt me, Jacques

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.130
We're a man and wife

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:26.130
And we do things my way

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:29.130
Are you serious?

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:32.130
We're gonna do things your way?

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:33.130
That's right

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:34.130
Uh-uh

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:36.130
No one tells me what to do, Marie

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.130
I'm a free man, remember?

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.130
I ain't a slave

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.130
If you think you got yourself a slave when you married me

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.130
You're wrong

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.130
It doesn't make no difference that we're married

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:49.130
I'm gonna do things my way

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:51.130
And no one is gonna stop me

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:54.130
You're gonna do things your way

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:56.130
I sure am

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:58.130
And that includes seeing other women

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:02.130
Marie, I will go where I want

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.130
See who I want

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.130
And do what I want

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:10.130
And there ain't a damn thing you can do about it

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:12.130
Oh, Jacques

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:15.130
You should not have said that

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:18.130
You really shouldn't have said that

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:22.130
You have to learn never ever

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:25.130
To make me angry

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.130
Marie

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:30.130
Are you okay?

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:31.130
No, Blanche

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:32.130
I'm not okay

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:34.130
Where's Jacques?

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:35.130
I don't know

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:36.130
And I don't care

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:38.130
Marie

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:40.130
It's your wedding day

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:42.130
You just got married

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:45.130
And you don't know where your husband is

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:47.130
And you don't care

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:48.130
No, Blanche

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.130
I don't

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:52.130
Marie, what's happened to you?

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:54.130
What do you mean?

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:56.130
You look different

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:58.130
Your eyes

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:01.130
I don't know what's happened to me Blanche

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:04.130
But I sure as hell feel different

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:05.130
I feel

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:07.130
Angry and

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.130
I don't know

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.130
I also feel strong

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:12.130
From now on

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:16.130
I'm not gonna take any nonsense from Jack or anyone

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:18.130
And first of all

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:22.130
I'm gonna take care of that little trap he was talking to

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.130
You know her name?

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:25.130
I...

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:28.130
No, I don't know her name

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:30.130
I think you do Blanche

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.130
Tell me

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:33.130
Marie, tell me

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:37.130
I think her name is Gina Baptiste

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:40.130
Do you know where she lives?

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:42.130
No, really I don't

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:45.130
Blanche, find out where she lives for me

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:49.130
Okay, but Blanche don't try to tell me what to do

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.130
It's too late for that

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:53.130
Okay Marie

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:56.180
I'll find out where she lives

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:00.130
A few days later

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:03.180
Gina was in her room at the room in house

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.130
Who's there?

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.130
Is that you, Jack?

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:10.130
Jack?

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.130
Jack?

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.130
Are you...

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:15.130
What the hell is...

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:17.130
Oh!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.130
Help!

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:19.130
Someone help me!

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:21.130
What's going on up there?

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:23.130
This is disgusting!

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.130
What's all the fuss about?

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:27.130
Did you see anyone coming up to my door?

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.130
Lady, there's always people coming to your door

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.130
Someone just knocked on my door

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:34.130
Did you see anyone?

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:36.130
Well, I saw a woman going up the stairs

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:38.130
What did she look like?

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:40.130
I didn't see her face

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:42.130
Anyway, what you yelling about?

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:43.180
Look!

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.130
My log is...

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:48.130
There's blood everywhere

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:50.130
What is it?

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:53.130
Well, it was an animal

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:55.130
Chicken, I guess now it's just blood

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:59.130
And feathers and bones and stuff

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:01.130
And look at my door!

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:03.130
There's blood on my door

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:04.130
Oh my God!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:05.130
What is it?

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:08.130
Someone wrote the letter M on your dog

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.130
What does it mean?

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:13.130
Lady, you ain't from New Orleans, are you?

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.130
No!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:17.130
Why did they write M on my door?

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:19.130
Don't you know nothing?

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.130
It's the first letter of the word mort

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.130
That's French

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:25.130
It means death

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:28.130
And it's written on your door in blood

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:33.180
Man, someone just put a curse on you

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:41.130
Of course, it was Marie who wrote the letter M in blood on Gina's door

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:46.130
Afterwards, she went out into the street and ran in the direction of her house

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.130
But she didn't make it

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:53.130
I'm sorry, I didn't see you

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:57.130
No, just hold on there, Ma

00:13:57.180 --> 00:14:00.130
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to run into you now

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:02.130
If you don't mind, I'll just be going

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:05.130
I said, hold on there

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:08.130
And calm down

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:11.130
Now, are you okay?

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:12.130
I'm fine

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:17.130
Mom, you have blood all over your hands and your clothes

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:19.130
Oh my God

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:22.130
I think you should tell me what's going on here

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:25.130
No, take your hands off me and let me go

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:28.130
Mom, maybe you don't know me

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:30.130
But I can help you

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.130
What are you talking about?

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.130
Who are you?

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:36.130
My name is John Bayou

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.130
John Bayou?

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:41.130
Yes, but around here

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:45.180
People call me Dr. John

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:48.130
Dr. John

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:51.130
Oh Lord Jesus, you're a voodoo doctor

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:56.130
Mom, I'm just a preacher in a church for freed slaves

00:14:56.180 --> 00:15:00.130
I don't really like the expression voodoo doctor

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:03.130
But it's what you are, leave me alone

